# Pure Simple English programming showcase in Lyslyn

# Natural English collections
Set languages to a list of "Lyslyn", "Python" and "Rust"
Add "SQL" to languages

Display "Active languages:", languages

# Natural English object definition
Set profile to an object with:
    username: "Raj"
    role: "Architect"
    age: 21

Display "User profile:", profile.username, "-", profile.role

# Natural English conditions
If profile.age is at least 18:
    Display "Welcome, adult user!"
Otherwise:
    Display "Welcome, junior user!"

If languages is not empty:
    Display "Language list is verified and non-empty."

If profile.age is odd:
    Display "Age is an odd number."

# Natural English iteration and loop control
Display "\n--- Iterating Over Languages ---"
For every lang in languages:
    If lang is equal to "Lyslyn":
        Display "Found primary language:", lang
        Stop the loop
    Display "Language option:", lang

# Natural English repetition
Display "\n--- Repeating an Action ---"
Do 3 times:
    Display "Lyslyn makes coding simple English!"

# Natural English function definition with Give back
Create a function called greet with name and role:
    Give back "Hello " + name + " (" + role + ")"

# Function calling
Set greeting to Call greet with "Raj" and "Architect"
Display greeting

Create a function called announce with event and date:
    Display "Announcement: [" + event + "] scheduled on " + date

Call announce with "Lyslyn 1.0.0 Launch" and "October 2026"
